.TH SDL_HINT_OPENXR_LIBRARY 3 "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 FUNCTIONS"
.SH NAME
SDL_HINT_OPENXR_LIBRARY \- A variable that specifies the library name to use when loading the OpenXR loader.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_hints.h>
.PP
.BI "#define SDL_HINT_OPENXR_LIBRARY \(dqSDL_OPENXR_LIBRARY\(dq
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
By default, SDL will try the system default name, but on some platforms like Windows, debug builds of the OpenXR loader have a different name, and are not always directly compatible with release applications\[char46] Setting this hint allows you to compensate for this difference in your app when applicable\[char46]
.PP
This hint should be set before the OpenXR loader is loaded\[char46] For example, creating an OpenXR GPU device will load the OpenXR loader\[char46]

